<title>Syria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/syria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-syria-2026-10-11T12:24:57.470Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 12:24:57 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Israeli drones intensified attacks near the Syria‑Lebanon border, wounding six people in Lebanon and striking a Syrian operative linked to Iran as well as a Syrian &amp;quot;terrorist&amp;quot; operating along the border. Syrian security forces dismantled an ISIS cell in Homs province and stepped up operations against former regime loyalists, while ethnic fighting erupted in Hasaka between Kurds and Arabs. Damascus condemned Houthi attacks on Riyadh airport and backed Saudi security, and the UN Security Council reaffirmed Syria's sovereignty. Prospects for a thaw in Polish‑Syrian relations and an expansion of the Abraham Accords were discussed. The conflict caused 2,732 battle‑related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/uk-news/2026/oct/10/uk-gaza-refugee-resettlement-scheme-palestinians-home-office&quot;&gt;theguardian.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE5TVzRaQXdvUlo5MkVLd00zb1E2WWpDUERYczFHOXV5YlZNWEVSbFlJRnY0Q0xXS2tWb2lYSV90YW42VXNZYm9CZVM3eUxhaFdCbjBNUFhNNA?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxQZjl6bUdFRGRBUjFvUU82VFNSSHVZVDdUMTJlTjdzdUx6NG9mQlJkT0JkSnB3bXhqTERhLTEzY3JQaUVJYVhiVnJtV1c2YlZDT1VuNUNZWFFvcnltZ3F6RENqdHRfTFJYYTZqNlNMMWtvY2s2NDBNS1I0TXl1TVVwUmtMTG5lTWhkUWN6U0VGQ1ZmMzJSd0pjVy1xcHFzcmVLaGd3TVpn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Defence24.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMickFVX3lxTE02c255OTNLTFRuMFZuakh6TzV1Wk1WNl9Ia0kyR0V6Zkk0UkdSNFEtUGI3WlYwWUgwSjhKdW02dEsxc1FZTHVTZ1lGUThpN3FjUEYxa1NqN0wxbGMzX0ot